abstract: "Long-form archive of the Tamesis research trajectory, including historical and speculative branches and the current Tamesis M_c v1 quantum-to-classical transition program. The frozen computational phase specifies a phenomenological model, synthetic identifiability tests, competing-model comparisons, metrology requirements, and a fail-closed A0/A1 blind-thermometry protocol. Hardware qualification has not started and the archive contains no physical evidence for Tamesis. The DOI identifies the earlier archived Tamesis Theory v2.0 release; protocol-level identifiers should be cited for the current work."
